1 CLASS CLASSES Combat, Piloting, Engineering, Bounty Hunting, Smuggling,
Diplomacy, Leadership, Force, Medical, Chemist, Scoundrel, Ambassador,
Scout, Snitch, Commando~
&WClasses&w

The old classes have been removed in favor of an ability system that lets
you advance in several areas at once.   These ability classes are as
follows:

  Combat      - Combat +100, Leadership +50
  Piloting    - Piloting +100, Engineering +20, Smnuggling +20, Diplomacy +10
  Engineering - Engineering +100, Piloting +20, Smuggling +25
  Bounty Hunting - Bounty Hunting +100, Combat +25, Piloting +25
  Smuggling   - Smuggling +100, Piloting +50
  Diplomacy   - Diplomacy +100, Leadership +50
  Leadership  - Leadership +100, Diplomacy +50
  Force       - Force +20, Combat +25, Piloting +25
  Medical     - Medical +100

There are six hybrid classes:
  Chemist     - Engineering +75, Medical +75
  Scoundrel   - Combat +75, Smuggling +75
  Ambassador  - Diplomacy +60; Force Random Roll
  Scout       - Combat +75, Bounty Hunting +50
  Snitch      - Bounty Hunting +100, Smuggling +50
  Commando    - Combat +50, Smuggling +50, Bounty Hunting +50

~

