autocannon  - toggle autocannon fitting        (Head Imm only)
autodamage  - autocannon damage per hit, 0-255 (Head Imm only)
autoammo    - autocannon ammo capacity, 0-255  (Head Imm only)

Most numeric fields are capped per ship class.
