101 SHOPSET~
Syntax: shopset <mobile vnum> <field> <value>

-----------------------------------------------
| Fields | Meaning                            |
-----------------------------------------------
| buy0-4 | Types of items the keeper will buy |
| buy    | Profit on buying items             |
| sell   | Profit on selling items            |
| open   | Hour shop opens                    |
| close  | Hour shop closes                   |
| keeper | Vnum of shop keeper                |
-----------------------------------------------

Lets you set certain stats on a shop. There are 5 buy-type slots
(buy0 through buy4) - each can be set to either the numeric item
type or its name directly (e.g. "shopset 227 buy0 weapon" works the
same as "shopset 227 buy0 5"). See SHOPVALUES for the full list.

see MAKESHOP, SHOPSTAT, SHOPS and SHOPVALUES
~

