1 MAKEBLADE~
Syntax : makeblade <blade name>

This allows you to make a vibro-blade using a toolkit(reuseable), some durasteel, a
battery and an oven (reuseable). Better-quality durasteel produces a
sharper, more damaging blade, independent of your own crafting skill.
The finished blade also carries a permanent backstab bonus and a small
hitroll/damroll bonus.
~

