Syntax : makeaxe <axe name>
Requirements: toolkit (reusable), durasteel, battery, oven (reusable)

This allows you to craft a vibro-axe. Better-quality durasteel produces
a harder, more damaging axe head, independent of your own crafting
skill.

See also: durasteel, weapons_master
