1 MAKEFORCEPIKE~
Syntax : makeforcepike <force pike name>
Requirements: toolkit (reusable), durasteel, battery, oven (reusable)

This allows you to craft a force pike. Better-quality durasteel
produces a more damaging force pike, independent of your own crafting
skill. A finished force pike also carries permanent disarm, hitroll,
and damroll bonuses that scale with your crafting level.
