~

1 CHANDELLE~
Syntax: chandelle

A chandelle, is a common aerial flight maneuver, in which the craft changes
its altitude to begin turning itself around. Since this was adapted for
space combat, there is no actual altitude change, instead, it is a
maneuver to simply turn your craft around.
~

1 CHEAP ATTACK CHEAPATTACK~
Cheap attack is a sneaky attack, but unlike backstab, its not a single
lonesome attack, but several small attacks in which is a free opening
round to the attacker.
~

1 CLANSELLSHIP~
Syntax: clansellship [name]

This allows you to sell a clan ship, if your clan has seen it fit for you
to be able to do so.
 
See also: EMPOWER CLANBUYSHIP
~

1 CLOAK CLOAKING~
Syntax: cloak
Syntax: cloak off

Cloaking allows a ship to simply disappear from sensors, and get away
without leaving much of a trace. It does eat up some fuel, and not all
ships may be cloaked forever, but they can be for significant amounts of
time. The downside of cloaking, is that you may not participate in most
normal ship functions, such as fighting, or travelling. You may stay
intersystem, but no hyperspatial travel can be made, and you cannot land
or dock while cloaked.
~

