Syntax: connect [firstobj] [secondobj]

Connect is a unique little code snippet that was written by Shriak. It is
very interesting because you can take two pieces, and connect them to form
a new object. This object can be another piece, or perhaps an actual
completed copy. It is rarely used at this time, however, may become
popular among builders for mobquests.
~

