~

1 EMBED_COMLINK~
Syntax: embed_comlink [obj] [obj]
Requirements: comlink, armor, thread

  This skill requires a needle, a comlink, and a piece of armor. A
successful embedding of the comlink will insert the comlink into the
armor, giving it the attributes of a comlink, without really being a
comlink. A failed attempt will simply destroy the comlink, and damage the
armor.
~

1 FLUSHPOISON~
Syntax: flushpoison

Description: Flushing poison out of your system is very difficult, and only
the most experienced players could ever accomplish it. But it is very
simple, those who are of strong will, can simply take large drinks of
fluid and simply push any foreign chemicals out of their bodies,
effectively pushing the poison out of their bodies. It requires liquid to
be performed properly. 
~

