&WSyntax&w: craft_item [id] [name] 
&w
Makemedpac is one of the various design skills associated with the 
medical class. The following item types can be crafted using 
makemedpac:
&W-&wmedpac     
&w
&WRequirements vary by item, check the schematic first. 
&WSee Also&w: craft_item craft_menu schematic_info 
~

1 MAKESHOT~
&WSyntax&w: craft_item [id] [name]  
&w
Makeshot is one of the various design skills associated with the 
medical class. The following item types can be crafted using makeshot:
&W-&wshot     
&w
&WRequirements vary by item, check the schematic first. 
&WSee Also&w: craft_item craft_menu schematic_info 
~

1 MIX~
&WSyntax&w: mix [medicine] [medicine]
&WRequires&w: two different medicines, toolkit, oven, drinkcon
&w
&wJust because medicines may have some properties does not mean that you 
&wcould not perhaps mix them to share the properties. Up to two medicines
&wcan be mixed together to provide supplemental properties. 
&w
&wWere you looking for mixliquid?
~

1 MYCLAN~
Syntax: myclan
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
This command details your clans specific details.
~

1 NEGOTIATE~
Syntax: negotiate [target]

Negotiate is a skill that requires money to utilize, but is a modified form
of bribery. Instead of outright trying to make them like you, you pay them
to stop fighting you. This can be quite annoying as some players/mobs may
or may NOT like the fact that you ended the fight, feel short ended, and
may give you pursuit anyways. This is only a temporary fight stopper.
~

1 OVERDRIVE~
&BSyntax: overdrive
Syntax: overdrive off

Overdrive is a skill for you pilot types to really give speed a go. Pilots
who take advantage of overdrive nodes(required to be installed in ship to
work) can achieve speeds up to twice what the engine could normally pull
by diverting extreme amounts of extra energy to the engines.      
~

1 OVERTHROW~
Syntax: overthrow [clan]
 
Use this to overthrow a clan and become its Leader. Leader position must be
empty for this to work. You do not have to be in the said clan in order to
overthrow it.  Note: You must be an Avatar in order to use this skill.
 
Updated By: Siek, 7-1-2001
~

1 PALM~
Syntax: palm [object]
Syntax: palm [object] [container]

Palm is just like using the get command, it is virtually a mirror image of
it. With one small difference, when one palms an object, there is a large
chance that it will go  unnoticed. The ability to palm, is what makes
being a thief interesting. If they do not see you take the object, then
obviously you did not.
 
See also: get tuck slide
~

1 PLOT~
Syntax: plot [starsystem] 
&w 
This command was developed to aid in navigating the universe. It
provides starsystems that are closer to your destination than 
your current position. It does NOT select the optimized course 
but should give you sufficient information to make your own 
decision. This SHOULD aid substantially in making really long 
hyperspace trips, from one side of the galaxy to the other. 
~

1 PREPSHIP~
&WSyntax&w: prepship
&w
&wThis command allows you to prepare a ship for launching, or simply
repair a frigate plus vessel when docked with a space station. It 
costs many credits to repair a vessel at a space station, you have 
been warned. 
~

1 QPBUY QUESTTABLE QUESTTABLE2 RELIC RELICS~
.+--------------------------------------------------------+               
 |                    QPBuy Table                         |               
 +--------------------------------------------------------+               
 | Variable     | What it does                     | Cost |               
 +--------------+----------------------------------+------+               
 | Hum          | Makes one Object Hum             | 1    |               
 | Glow         | Makes one object Glow            | 1    |               
 | Force        | Buy +5 levels of force-No bhers  | 1000 |               
