 | Youth        | -1 year Older                    | 100  |               
 | Str          | +1 to base strength              | 100  |               
 | Int          | +1 to base intelligence          | 100  |               
 | Wis          | +1 to base wisdom                | 100  |               
 | Dex          | +1 to base Dexterity             | 100  |               
 | Con          | +1 to base Constitution          | 250  |               
